  "body": "![Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c43e9cedf29fc73e3a825b1b5d2ff8cec8f832fa.png)\n![FEATURES](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1318712716f68f249a1e3cf2fb7cff40bb04e24b.png)\n\n- 🌽 60+ Farmers Delight Mods\n- 🌽 Custom Loot\n- 🌽 200+ New Recipies\n- 🌽 Custom Biomes and Structures\n- 🌴 4 Pre-Set shaders (Iris shaders)\n- 🌴 Preformance mods\n- 🌴 QoL Mods\n\n# Notice:\nA LTS (Long-term Support) version of this modpack has been released. While I will regularly add versions for the newest minecraft versions, the LTS version will contain the most farmers delight mods. So if you perfer more mods over minecraft version, its recommended to download the LTS version of this modpack.\n\n\n\n# Ingame images:\n![Foods in the creative inventory](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d5d6f6aa3ff695065b2a781a2584888e123d6f7e.png)\n![JEI 103 pages](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/efbecfbf332be3ec8c2743bf359f8512a70dbd62.png)\n",
